   "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Productive Facades Survey</title>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"sp-scheme\">\n{\n \"format\": \"sp-scheme-package\",\n \"spScheme\": \"2.0\",\n \"survey\": {\n  \"title\": \"Productive Facades Survey\",\n  \"description\": \"Faithful replication of the expert web survey on productive facades (PF) for Singapore public housing (HDB) blocks: facades that combine tilted photovoltaic (PV) shading modules with vertical-farming (VF) planters for vegetables or ornamental plants. Participants rate rendered design variants on the paper's five-point scale (very poor, poor, fair, good, very good) in nine blocks: the exterior facade (clean, plants, PV, PV plus plants), the view from inside, PV module position seen from inside, planter position seen from inside, PV module arrangement, safety grill design, ease of operation and functionality, and the overall architectural quality of five window-facade and five balcony-facade designs. They first answer six background questions (gender, profession, industry sector, years of professional experience, experience in PV building integration, experience in farming, green facades or horticulture) and may comment at the end. Rebuilt from Tablada, Kosoric, Huang, Lau & Shabunko (2020), Architectural quality of the productive facades integrating photovoltaic and vertical farming systems: Survey among experts in Singapore, Frontiers of Architectural Research 9(2): 301-318, Section 2.1 and Table 1, with the stimuli from its Figs. 3-11 (CC BY-NC-ND 4.0; figures unchanged, the result chart printed above each set of designs is hidden by cropping the view, so participants see only the designs and their captions). The question wording is the paper's, as printed in each figure title. Image ids: exterior, view_inside, pv_position, plants_position, pv_arrangement, safety_grill, operation, quality_wf and quality_bf; the answer rating (1 = very poor to 5 = very good) is keyed <image id>_d<design number>, e.g. exterior_d4. Analysis as in the paper: share of each grade and the mean grade per design, compared between architects and designers and other professionals and between those with and without PV or horticulture experience. The paper (97 building professionals, 79% architects) found the exterior facade with PV and plants rated best (3.54 against 2.23 for the clean facade), plants seen from inside raised view ratings (3.90) while visible PV lowered them (2.84), one PV module per window or balcony beat two or three smaller ones, and architects and designers gave lower grades to designs with PV. Differences from the original study: (1) question 6 (material, texture and colour of PV modules and planters) is left out because its images are not printed; (2) the paper's introductory section had 15 questions, of which only the six demographic items are known from Table 1, so the other nine are left out, and the wording and answer options of these six follow Table 1 but the question text is ours; (3) the paper allowed a comment after each question; here one comment is asked at the end; (4) blocks appear in the paper's order and the introduction and consent text are ours.\",\n  \"locale\": \"en\",\n  \"mediaFolders\": [\n   \"designs\"\n  ],\n  \"pages\": [\n   {\n    \"name\": \"about\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\",\n      \"name\": \"consent\",\n      \"title\": \"I agree to take part. Participation is voluntary and my answers are recorded anonymously for research.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"labelTrue\": \"I agree\",\n      \"labelFalse\": \"I do not agree\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"gender\",\n      \"title\": \"Gender\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"female\",\n        \"text\": \"Female\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"male\",\n        \"text\": \"Male\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"other\",\n        \"text\": \"Other or prefer not to say\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"profession\",\n      \"title\": \"Profession\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"architect\",\n        \"text\": \"Architect\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"consultant\",\n        \"text\": \"Consultant\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"pv_expert\",\n        \"text\": \"PV expert\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"manager\",\n        \"text\": \"Manager\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"engineer\",\n        \"text\": \"Engineer\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"vertical_farming_expert\",\n        \"text\": \"Vertical farming expert\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"designer\",\n        \"text\": \"Designer\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"other\",\n        \"text\": \"Other\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"sector\",\n      \"title\": \"Industry sector\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"design\",\n        \"text\": \"Design\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"construction\",\n        \"text\": \"Construction\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"academic_research\",\n        \"text\": \"Academic-research\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"consulting_services\",\n        \"text\": \"Consulting services\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"project_management\",\n        \"text\": \"Project management\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"engineering\",\n        \"text\": \"Engineering\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"other\",\n        \"text\": \"Other\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"years\",\n      \"title\": \"Years of professional experience\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"1to5\",\n        \"text\": \"1-5\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"6to10\",\n        \"text\": \"6-10\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"11to15\",\n        \"text\": \"11-15\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"16to20\",\n        \"text\": \"16-20\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"gt20\",\n        \"text\": \"Over 20\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"pv_experience\",\n      \"title\": \"Do you have experience in PV building integration?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"yes\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"no\",\n        \"text\": \"No\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"green_experience\",\n      \"title\": \"Do you have experience in farming, green facades or horticulture?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"yes\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"no\",\n        \"text\": \"No\"\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"designs\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"rating\",\n      \"title\": \"How would you rate this design?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"1\",\n        \"text\": \"Very poor\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"2\",\n        \"text\": \"Poor\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"3\",\n        \"text\": \"Fair\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"4\",\n        \"text\": \"Good\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"5\",\n        \"text\": \"Very good\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"comment\",\n      \"name\": \"comments\",\n      \"title\": \"Any further comments, concerns or suggestions? (optional)\",\n      \"isRequired\": false\n     }\n    ]\n   }\n  ]\n }\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"pv-original\">{\"source\": \"Tablada et al. (2020) Frontiers of Architectural Research 9(2): 301-318\", \"n\": 97, \"blocks\": [{\"id\": \"exterior\", \"no\": \"1\", \"text\": \"How would you rate the following exterior façade designs?\", \"designs\": 4, \"crop\": 626, \"w\": 1536, \"figure\": \"Fig. 3\", \"paperMeans\": [2.23, 3.14, 3.1, 3.54]}, {\"id\": \"view_inside\", \"no\": \"2\", \"text\": \"How would you rate the view from inside in the following designs?\", \"designs\": 4, \"crop\": 657, \"w\": 1536, \"figure\": \"Fig. 4\", \"paperMeans\": [3.13, 3.9, 2.84, 3.34]}, {\"id\": \"pv_position\", \"no\": \"3\", \"text\": \"How would you rate the visual impact from inside of the following PV panels position?\", \"designs\": 3, \"crop\": 753, \"w\": 1536, \"figure\": \"Fig. 5\", \"paperMeans\": [3.45, 2.24, 1.65]}, {\"id\": \"plants_position\", \"no\": \"4\", \"text\": \"How would you rate the visual impact from inside of the following plants position?\", \"designs\": 4, \"crop\": 666, \"w\": 1536, \"figure\": \"Fig. 6\", \"paperMeans\": [2.94, 3.15, 3.25, 3.95]}, {\"id\": \"pv_arrangement\", \"no\": \"5\", \"text\": \"From the aesthetic point of view, how would you rate the arrangement of PV panels in the following designs?\", \"designs\": 4, \"crop\": 692, \"w\": 1654, \"figure\": \"Fig. 7\", \"paperMeans\": [3.45, 2.93, 2.68, 2.63]}, {\"id\": \"safety_grill\", \"no\": \"7\", \"text\": \"How would you rate the visual effect of the following safety grill designs?\", \"designs\": 4, \"crop\": 716, \"w\": 1654, \"figure\": \"Fig. 8\", \"paperMeans\": [2.67, 3.35, 3.21, 2.75]}, {\"id\": \"operation\", \"no\": \"8\", \"text\": \"How would you rate ease of operation and functionality of the following designs?\", \"designs\": 4, \"crop\": 749, \"w\": 1654, \"figure\": \"Fig. 9\", \"paperMeans\": [2.59, 3.16, 3.01, 3.42]}, {\"id\": \"quality_wf\", \"no\": \"9\", \"text\": \"How would you rate the overall architectural quality of the following designs? (Window façades)\", \"designs\": 5, \"crop\": 742, \"w\": 1654, \"figure\": \"Fig. 10\", \"paperMeans\": [2.88, 3.59, 2.75, 2.49, 2.67]}, {\"id\": \"quality_bf\", \"no\": \"9\", \"text\": \"How would you rate the overall architectural quality of the following designs? (Balcony façades)\", \"designs\": 5, \"crop\": 738, \"w\": 1654, \"figure\": \"Fig. 11\", \"paperMeans\": [3.27, 3.06, 2.64, 2.15, 2.69]}]}</script>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#f2f1ee;--card:#fff;--ink:#1d1d1b;--muted:#5d5c57;--accent:#2b5d7a;--line:#dad8d2;--warn:#b3261e;--sel:#dce9f1}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:17px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,sans-serif}\nmain{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:22px 16px 40px}\nh1{font-size:1.5rem;margin:0 0 8px}h2{font-size:1.08rem;margin:0 0 6px}p{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 18px;margin-top:14px}\n.btn{appearance:none;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 20px;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:#fff}\n.btn:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:not-allowed}\n.prog{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}\n.fig{overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px}\n.fig .in{min-width:0;max-width:760px;margin:0 auto}.fig .in.wide{min-width:560px;max-width:none}\n.crop{overflow:hidden;position:relative}.crop img{position:absolute;left:0;width:100%;height:auto;display:block}\ntextarea,input[type=text]{font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;width:100%;margin-top:6px}\n.qno{color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}\n.fig .lab{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);text-align:center;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);padding:2px 0 6px}\n.hint{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 0}\n@media (min-width:700px){.hint{display:none}}\n.picks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;margin-top:12px}\n.picks label{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 6px;font-weight:700;font-size:1.1rem;cursor:pointer;background:#fff}\n.picks label:has(input:checked){background:var(--sel);border-color:var(--accent)}\n.picks input{display:none}\n.q{margin-top:16px}.q:first-child{margin-top:0}\n.q.miss,.picks.miss{outline:2px solid var(--warn);outline-offset:3px;border-radius:10px}\nlabel.opt{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-top:6px;cursor:pointer;font-size:.95rem}\ninput[type=number]{font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;max-width:140px;margin-top:6px}\n.err{color:var(--warn);margin-top:8px;min-height:1.2em}\n.credit{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 24px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}\n.drow{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:10px 0}.drow:first-child{border-top:0}\n.drow b{display:block;margin-bottom:6px}\n.scale{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:6px}\n.scale label{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;text-align:center;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 2px;font-size:.84rem;cursor:pointer;background:#fff;line-height:1.2;min-height:44px}\n.scale label:has(input:checked){background:var(--sel);border-color:var(--accent);font-weight:600}\n.scale input{display:none}\n.drow.miss{outline:2px solid var(--warn);outline-offset:3px;border-radius:10px}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main id=\"app\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>Loading…</p></main>\n<footer class=\"credit\">Design images and question wording: Tablada, Kosorić, Huang, Lau &amp; Shabunko (2020), Frontiers of Architectural Research 9(2): 301–318, Figs. 3–11 (doi:10.1016/j.foar.2019.12.005, CC BY-NC-ND 4.0; figures unchanged, cropped in view only).</footer>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var KEY='prodfacade:state';\n  var ORIG=JSON.parse(document.getElementById('pv-original').textContent), BL=ORIG.blocks;\n  var P1=['gender','profession','sector','years','pv_experience','green_experience'];\n  var app=document.getElementById('app'), Q={}, files={}, st=null;\n  function esc(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;'}[c];});}\n  function err(m){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e)e.textContent=m||'';}\n  function ok(r){return !(r&&r.ok===false);}\n  function save(){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(st));}catch(e){}}\n  function send(list,b,next){if(b)b.disabled=true;Promise.all(list).then(function(rs){var bad=rs.filter(function(r){return !ok(r);})[0];if(bad){if(b)b.disabled=false;return err(bad.error);}next();});}\n  function fresh(){return {step:'intro',i:0};}\n  function chs(q){return (q.choices||[]).map(function(c){return typeof c==='string'?{value:c,text:c}:c;});}\n  function radios(n){var q=Q[n];return '<div class=\"q\" data-q=\"'+n+'\"><b>'+esc(q.title)+'</b>'+chs(q).map(function(c){return '<label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+n+'\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div>';}\n  function pick(n){var x=app.querySelector('input[name=\"'+n+'\"]:checked');return x?x.value:null;}\n  function bad(n,m){var el=app.querySelector('[data-q=\"'+n+'\"]');el.classList.add('miss');el.scrollIntoView({block:'center'});err(m||('Please answer: '+Q[n].title));}\n  function intro(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Productive facades: solar panels and vertical farming</h1><p>Productive facades combine solar (PV) shading panels with planters for vegetables or ornamental plants on the outside of apartment blocks in Singapore. You will rate design variants in nine sets on a five-point scale from very poor to very good. It takes about 10 minutes.</p>'+\n     '<div class=\"card\"><label class=\"opt\" style=\"margin-top:0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ok\"> '+esc(Q.consent.title)+'</label></div><div class=\"card\">'+P1.map(radios).join('')+\n     '<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Start</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){if(!document.getElementById('ok').checked)return err('Consent is needed to continue.');\n      var vals={};for(var k=0;k<P1.length;k++){var v=pick(P1[k]);if(v==null)return bad(P1[k]);vals[P1[k]]=v;}\n      send([SPSite.answer('consent',true)].concat(P1.map(function(n){return SPSite.answer(n,vals[n]);})),this,function(){st.step='blocks';save();route();});};\n  }\n  function blockPage(){\n    var b=BL[st.i],f=files[b.id],top=b.crop-10,img=new Image();\n    var rows='';for(var d=1;d<=b.designs;d++){var nm='r_'+d;rows+='<div class=\"drow\" data-q=\"'+nm+'\"><b>Design '+d+'</b><div class=\"scale\">'+chs(Q.rating).map(function(c){return '<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+nm+'\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\">'+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div></div>';}\n    app.innerHTML='<div class=\"prog\">Set '+(st.i+1)+' of '+BL.length+'</div><h2><span class=\"qno\">Q'+b.no+'. </span>'+esc(b.text)+'</h2>'+\n     '<div class=\"fig\"><div class=\"in'+(b.w>1600?' wide':'')+'\"><div class=\"crop\" id=\"crop\"><img alt=\"Design variants with captions\" src=\"'+esc(f.url)+'\"></div></div></div>'+\n     (b.w>1600?'<p class=\"hint\">Swipe sideways to see all designs.</p>':'')+'<div class=\"card\">'+rows+'<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">'+(st.i+1<BL.length?'Next set':'Continue')+'</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    var im=app.querySelector('#crop img'),cr=app.querySelector('#crop');\n    function fit(){var w=im.naturalWidth,h=im.naturalHeight;if(!w)return;cr.style.paddingTop=((h-top)/w*100).toFixed(3)+'%';im.style.top='0';im.style.marginTop=(-top/w*100).toFixed(3)+'%';}\n    if(im.complete)fit();else im.onload=fit;\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){var vals=[];\n      for(var d=1;d<=b.designs;d++){var v=pick('r_'+d);if(v==null){var el=app.querySelector('[data-q=\"r_'+d+'\"]');el.classList.add('miss');el.scrollIntoView({block:'center'});return err('Please rate design '+d+'.');}vals.push(v);}\n      send(vals.map(function(v,k){return SPSite.answer('rating',Number(v),{key:b.id+'_d'+(k+1),shown:[f.name]});}),this,function(){st.i++;if(st.i>=BL.length)st.step='comments';save();route();});};\n  }\n  function comments(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h2>'+esc(Q.comments.title)+'</h2><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"q\" data-q=\"comments\"><textarea id=\"cm\" rows=\"4\" maxlength=\"2000\"></textarea></div><div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Finish</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){var v=document.getElementById('cm').value.trim();\n      send(v?[SPSite.answer('comments',v)]:[],this,function(){st.step='done';save();route();});};\n  }\n  function finish(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Thank you!</h1><div class=\"card\"><p id=\"fin\">Submitting…</p><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    SPSite.complete().then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){err(r.error||'Some answers are missing.');setTimeout(function(){st=fresh();save();route();},1800);}\n      else{try{localStorage.removeItem(KEY);}catch(e){}var s=document.getElementById('fin');if(s)s.textContent='Your answers are saved.';}});\n  }\n  function clr(e){var r=e.target.closest&&(e.target.closest('.drow')||e.target.closest('.q'));if(r){r.classList.remove('miss');if(!app.querySelector('.miss'))err('');}}\n  app.addEventListener('change',clr);app.addEventListener('input',clr);\n  function route(){window.scrollTo(0,0);if(st.step==='blocks')return blockPage();if(st.step==='comments')return comments();if(st.step==='done')return finish();intro();}\n  SPSite.onReady(function(ctx){\n    ['consent','rating','comments'].concat(P1).forEach(function(n){Q[n]=SPSite.getQuestion(n)||{name:n};});\n    (SPSite.getMedia('designs')||[]).forEach(function(f){files[f.name.replace(/\\.[^.]+$/,'')]=f;});\n    var need=BL.map(function(s){return s.id;}).filter(function(k){return !files[k];});\n    if(need.length){app.innerHTML='<h1>Images missing</h1><p>Upload '+esc(need.join(', '))+' (.jpg) to the media folder \"designs\".</p>';return;}\n    try{st=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY));}catch(e){st=null;}\n    var a=(ctx&&ctx.answers)||{};\n    if(!(st&&st.step)||a.consent!==true)st=fresh();\n    save();route();\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
